{
  "name": "HERMES-LAB - 09 AI Repurposer",
  "description": "Ladder step 5 capstone: 1 source article -> 3 chained Basic LLM Chain calls on local bonsai-2:4b (tweet, marketing email, 3 headlines) -> Content Pack shaper. Continue-on-Fail (onError continueRegularOutput on each chain). Needs the ollamaApi credential b",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ddb55947-48b5-400e-ba63-7a9c1caa6ed4",
      "name": "Start",
